      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS proudly present this bright and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached home to the market, ideally situated in the mature and highly sought-after Summerfield Rise development. The property enjoys a convenient location just minutes from Blanchardstown Village and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, with an extensive range of schools, shops, cafes, bars and recreational facilities nearby. Several bus routes serve the area, Coolmine Train Station is approximately five minutes away by car, and the N3 and M50 road networks are easily accessible.\n\nExtending to approximately 107 sq. m, the accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest WC, front lounge with double doors leading to a separated dining room/ sunroom, and a full fitted kitchen positioned to the rear. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms, including the master bedroom with en-suite, together with the main family bathroom.\n\nTo the front, the property benefits from off-street parking and a low-maintenance garden. The rear garden has a desirable SOUTH-WEST facing orientation, ideal for enjoying the afternoon and evening sun, and can also be accessed through a gated side entrance.\nNumber 49 comes to the market in turn-key condition while offering its new owners an excellent blank canvas to make their own. Offered for sale with no onward chain, it is ideally suited to first-time buyers, growing families, investors or those looking to trade up.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 01 554 1699 for further information.\n \nAdditional Features:\n \n Blank Canvas Family home\n 3 Bed/3 Bath\n Semi-detached home with side entrance\n Vacant with no onward chain\n Brand new boiler Jan 2026\n Brand new carpets upstairs\n c. 107 sq m\n BER D\n Gas fired central heating\n Off street parking to the front\n Low maintenance front graden\n SOUTH WEST rear orientation for the sunny evenings\n Prime for first time buyers, Investors and families trading up\n Situated in a quiet cul de sac\n Fantastic location in a mature & sought out development\n Within minutes to Blanchardstown shopping Centre and Blanch Village\n- Coolmine Train station c. 5 minutes away\n Viewing highly advised!\n\nDirections: \n \nEircode = D15 Y62W\n\nDriving from Supervalu on the main street, take a left onto the Clonsilla Road and take the 3rd right turn into Summerfield Avenue. Keep going straight until you reach the green and take a right turn, follow the road through and No. 49 will be located on the right hand side in the cul-de-sac."
      },
